logo.png     declared image/png, content image/png: ok
photo.JPG    declared image/jpeg, content image/jpeg: ok
avatar.png   declared image/png, content text/html; charset=utf-8: mismatch
scan.jpg     declared image/jpeg, content image/png: mismatch
data.json    declared application/json, content application/json: ok
notes.txt    declared text/plain; charset=utf-8, content text/plain; charset=utf-8: ok
blob.bin     declared unknown, content application/octet-stream: unknown extension
bundle.zip   declared application/zip, content application/zip: ok
empty.txt    declared text/plain; charset=utf-8, content text/plain; charset=utf-8: ok
image/jpeg is stored as .jpg
Text/HTML; charset=utf-8 is stored as .html
application/pdf is stored as .pdf
application/x-unknown has no known extension
